{"t": 1794120082.918964, "kind": "call", "tool": "github_create_pull_request", "args": {"base": "main", "body": "The API documents page numbers as 1-based, but `page()` computed the slice offset as `number * size`, so `page(items, 1, size)` returned the second page.\n\nThis computes the offset as `(number - 1) * size`, making page 1 the first page.\n\nVerified locally with a 25-item list: page 1 -> items 1-10, page 2 -> 11-20, page 3 -> 21-25.\n\nCloses #57", "head": "fix/pagination-57", "owner": "acme", "repo": "catalog", "title": "Fix page() to treat page numbers as 1-based (#57)"}, "ok": true}
